esp32-wiimmfi
=============

The ESP32 sketch (esp32-wiimmfi.ino) and project documentation are this
project's own work.

Bundled third-party component
-----------------------------

The server/ directory is a vendored copy (via `git subtree`) of:

    WiiLink24/wfc-server
    https://github.com/WiiLink24/wfc-server
    Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)

Its license text is preserved at server/LICENSE and its copyright headers are
left intact. The AGPL is a network-copyleft license: if you distribute this
repository or run a MODIFIED version of the server as a network service that
others interact with, you must offer the corresponding source of the server
under the AGPL-3.0.

Files added by this project under server/ (our own, to deploy the upstream
code) are:

    server/Dockerfile
    server/docker-entrypoint.sh
    server/config.xml.tmpl

To update the vendored server from upstream:

    git subtree pull --prefix=server \
        https://github.com/WiiLink24/wfc-server.git main --squash
